    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clocknockers 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >July 28th, 2069, The Clocknockers appeared here one week ago and they are messing with time again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to travel back one day at a time for 7 days to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several challenging levels with cool time bending effects...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- When You move, time moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- SlowMo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Freeze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rewind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Drive backward thru time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Time Pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Based Platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool &quot;Digitruck&quot; Time Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the Clocknockers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and Challenging 7 Days, 7 Levels with different time mechanics to master as You travel back in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples - When You move, time moves ; Slow Motion/Bullet-Time ; Freeze Time ; Rewind ; Drive backward thru time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and more!</p>",
